// Disable Windows Firewall by Registry | T1686.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_disable_windows_firewall.yml
(registry.path:(*\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsFirewall\\StandardProfile\\EnableFirewall OR *\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsFirewall\\DomainProfile\\EnableFirewall)) AND winlog.event_data.Details:"DWORD \(0x00000000\)"
